{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorangecompact\/orangecompacttheme"]}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/OrangeCompactTheme\/init(fontFamily:tuning:hasTypographyHeadingLargeMarker:)"],"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/OrangeCompactTheme\/name"],"title":"Type Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Properties"}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:23OUDSThemesOrangeCompact0bC5ThemeC","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange Compact"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeCompactTheme"}],"symbolKind":"class","title":"OrangeCompactTheme","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OrangeCompactTheme","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Class"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/OrangeCompactTheme","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/OUDSTheme"],"title":"Inherits From","type":"inheritsFrom","kind":"relationships"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/SQ","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"final"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OrangeCompactTheme"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Usages","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Usages"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Some products may have heavy and very rich user interfaces with a lot of components and elements to displays and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with which users can interact. Thus for such products there are specific constraints of spaces and sizes, even if","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"these products must be Orange flavored.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"That is the reason why this team is created: a kind of ","type":"text"},{"code":"OrangeTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" but wih adjustments on some tokens like spacings and sizings.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To get the theme:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    @Environment(\\.theme) var theme"]},{"text":"Integration","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Integration"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To use this theme, inject it to your view using ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSThemeableView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and get it through environment variable.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    @main","    struct YourApp: App {","        var body: some Scene {","            WindowGroup {","                OUDSThemeableView(theme: OrangeCompactTheme()) {","                    \/\/ Your root view","                }","            }","        }","    }"]},{"text":"Theme tuning","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Theme-tuning"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The theme can be customized a bit for more flexibility thanks to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Tuning","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" object.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You just need to give a predefined tuning configuration at theme init to build the one you need.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To apply the tuning:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Define your theme tuning","    let tuning = Tuning(hasRoundedButtons: true,","                        hasRoundedTextInputs: true,","                        hasRoundedAlertMessages: false,","                        hasRoundedProgressIndicators: true,","                        hasRoundedListItems: true)","","    \/\/ Apply it to your theme","    let theme = OrangeCompactTheme(tuning: tuning)","","    \/\/ Or apply predefined tunings","    let orangeFranceTheme = OrangeCompactTheme(tuning: Tuning.OrangeFrance)","    let orangeBusinessTheme = OrangeCompactTheme(tuning: Tuning.OrangeBusiness)","    let maxitTheme = OrangeCompactTheme(tuning: Tuning.MaxIt)"]},{"text":"Typography","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Typography"},{"text":"Helvetica Neue","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Helvetica-Neue"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The Orange brand strongly relies on the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Helvetica Neue","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" font family. Thus each Orange brand should, or must, use it.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For iOS the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Helvetica Neue","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" font family is available at system level, so it is not needed to get it through external assets.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"By default an instance of ","type":"text"},{"code":"OrangeCompactTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" uses as font family the token ","type":"text"},{"code":"OrangeBrandFontRawTokens.familyBrandDefault","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which is today ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Helvetica Neue","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"If you want to use another font family, you will have to send the suitable token or the suitable font family.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However, beware, iOS API relies also on the PostScript name of the font.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"To be sure of the value to use, look at the font book of your device.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It is recommended to use the font raw tokens.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ The following instanciations work","    let orangeTheme = OrangeCompactTheme()","    let orangeTheme = OrangeCompactTheme(fontFamily: OrangeBrandFontRawTokens.familyBrandDefault)","    let orangeTheme = OrangeCompactTheme(fontFamily: \"HelveticaNeue\") \/\/ Which is PostScript name of the font","    let orangeTheme = OrangeCompactTheme(fontFamily: \"Helvetica Neue\")"]},{"text":"Helvetica Neue Arabic","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Helvetica-Neue-Arabic"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Because the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Helvetica Neue","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" font family does not manage arabic alphabet but latin one, it is possible apply another font family to the theme like the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Helvetica Neue Arabic","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":". This font family assets can be retrieved through the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/brand.orange.com\/en\/brand-basics\/typography"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"PostScript name management has been implemented for this font family, thus the weight are managed and it is only needed to add the font assets to the project,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"register them and define the font family name to use.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    let orangeTheme = OrangeCompactTheme(fontFamily: \"Helvetica Neue Arabic\")"]},{"text":"Tokens versions","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Tokens-versions"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Core OUDS version: 1.10.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Core Orange version: 1.2.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Brand Orange Compact version: 2.5.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Since","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"0.17.0","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Orange Compact"},{"text":" theme is an Orange theme but tailored for some products with heavy UI.","type":"text"}],"references":{"ic_theme_orangecompact.png":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/ic_theme_orangecompact.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"identifier":"ic_theme_orangecompact.png","type":"image","alt":null},"doc://OUDSThemesOrangeCompact/documentation/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact/OrangeCompactTheme":{"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorangecompact\/orangecompacttheme","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeCompactTheme","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OrangeCompactTheme","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/OrangeCompactTheme","abstract":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"Orange Compact","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" theme is an Orange theme but tailored for some products with heavy UI.","type":"text"}],"title":"OrangeCompactTheme","role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrangeCompact/documentation/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact":{"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorangecompact","title":"Theme Orange Compact","kind":"symbol","images":[{"identifier":"ic_theme_orangecompact.png","type":"icon"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Orange Compact theme is dedicated to applications with strong dimensions constraints."}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrangeCompact/documentation/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact/OrangeCompactTheme/init(fontFamily:tuning:hasTypographyHeadingLargeMarker:)":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeCompact\/OrangeCompactTheme\/init(fontFamily:tuning:hasTypographyHeadingLargeMarker:)","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorangecompact\/orangecompacttheme\/init(fontfamily:tuning:hastypographyheadinglargemarker:)","title":"init(fontFamily:tuning:hasTypographyHeadingLargeMarker:)","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"fontFamily"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSTokensSemantic010FontFamilyB5Tokena","text":"FontFamilySemanticToken"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"tuning"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract6Tuninga","text":"Tuning"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"hasTypographyHeadingLargeMarker"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Constructor of the OrangeCompact theme with its own providers of tokens.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It uses also the providers of charts colors from Orange theme (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrangeThemeColorChartSemanticTokensProvider"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},"https://brand.orange.com/en/brand-basics/typography":{"title":"Orange Brand website (authentication needed)","identifier":"https:\/\/brand.orange.com\/en\/brand-basics\/typography","type":"link","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"Orange Brand website (authentication needed)